[{"client_msg_id":"36effccf-4a2c-4874-b972-7492f65cc5e8","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"\u003c@U8996GYBF\u003e entry point の shell script に対する refactor です。\n\u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/zeno.zsh/pull/40\u003e","ts":"1634790982.005400","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/zeno.zsh/pull/40|#40 Refactor shell scripts\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/zeno.zsh/pull/40|#40 Refactor shell scripts\u003e","text":"• Changed temporary directory to user environment.\n• Moved shell functions to separated files.\n• Renamed all shell functions to be prefixed `zeno-`.\n• Some fixed in shell scripts.","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/zeno.zsh|yuki-yano/zeno.zsh\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1634790897}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/XP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b0ab035-ed9f-4501-aa92-f060b83bdc35","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"じゃあもう入れちゃいますね","ts":"1634786216.004600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tada","count":2,"users":["UP6PA1UBE","U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9PcrE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b62f538-310d-4d9c-acb0-aae3caa574da","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"今のPRの続きで書いてますが、いったん今のと分離してあるので今のはマージしてもらえたら。","ts":"1634786203.004300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uIyO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3258f272-095a-4780-b7aa-1f9f962621fc","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"今のPRに入れます？","ts":"1634786159.003400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HQr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc9db377-275b-4df7-a9bf-10ae34552993","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"\u003c@U8996GYBF\u003e まず shell script まわりを refactor してます。いい感じに！","ts":"1634786141.003200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=oy9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58e1943b-37e2-47ea-9aa2-36b21d262d07","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"見た感じPRはひとまず通していい気がする、怪しかったら最悪Revert打てばいいし","ts":"1634782108.002000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vGiTT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4cc92055-1b72-4236-bc7d-9e994de51bce","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003c@UP6PA1UBE\u003e PR入れるとして、そのあといい感じに対応ってできそうか分かります？","ts":"1634781849.001500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f/AAQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"900995e7-80ab-4352-b15c-522fb01bf9fd","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"確かに適当にしかevalの対応してなかったと思うので、どうしようかな","ts":"1634781834.001100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DPS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc874c73-1f02-4cd5-b468-b780d7319505","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"すみません、ひとまずPR見ます","ts":"1634781792.000400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Zns"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9e6ec3b-0d0f-4287-a2af-48fc5aab563e","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"色々添削してるんですがマージ待ち。","ts":"1634763464.398100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ud+R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"099d6a18-b10a-460a-b883-ae072ab9666b","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"ts 部分から返った結果を zsh で eval するところがあまり一貫してない実装になってます。\nescape をどうしたいとか仕様が固まってない感じ。","ts":"1634763433.397800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+B4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d24eab5-ce19-45f5-9209-cb75904cfd1c","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"ts勉強しよ……。","ts":"1634746214.396300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G8h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c420176-5075-4f52-86bb-652df3f286d2","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"callbackで文字列をエスケープしようとするとバックスラッシュが消える……。\n```  - name: cd\n    patterns:\n      - \"^cd $\"\n    sourceCommand: \"exa -1 -D\"\n    options:\n      --prompt: \"'directory\u0026gt; '\"\n    callback: \"sed -E -e 's/(\\\\s)/\\\\\\\\\\\\1/g'\"```","ts":"1634746204.396100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e9K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54403f07-7999-4749-bf92-23cb698f83d6","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"`completions`で `options`に `--bind`を指定すると落ちるな……。","ts":"1634745448.395600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NMT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"03196bdf-f367-4cea-8ec9-9fd4357069c5","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"↓みたいなのだと `ls | less` にスペースを続けないと展開されないんですね。\n```  - name: less with colors\n    keyword: less\n    snippet: less -r\n    context:\n      lbuffer: '.+\\|\\s'```\nコマンドと同名のスニペットを作るのは避けて、`keyword: Less` と `alias Less='less -r'`を併用するのが吉……？","ts":"1634742491.395100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9hH"}]}]
